WEBVTT

00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:05.450
You three...

00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:08.120
Do you have any idea
why I called you here?

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:11.330
I guess it's about the test...

00:00:11.330 --> 00:00:13.090
Exactly.

00:00:13.090 --> 00:00:16.330
All three of you will be
taking the make-up test.

00:00:16.330 --> 00:00:18.130
Yeah, makes sense...

00:00:18.130 --> 00:00:20.890
We even studied for this test...

00:00:20.890 --> 00:00:21.600
A little.

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:23.840
Yeah, only a little...

00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:26.020
Oh well, this isn't new for us.

00:00:26.020 --> 00:00:28.810
It's pretty typical for us to take make-up tests.

00:00:28.810 --> 00:00:30.920
Oh well...

00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:34.150
If you three keep this up, then...

00:02:10.110 --> 00:02:14.410
Basically, if you don't manage to score an
average of at least 50 on the make-ups,

00:02:14.410 --> 00:02:15.950
you'll have to repeat the year?

00:02:16.230 --> 00:02:17.410
Looks like it...

00:02:17.410 --> 00:02:19.190
We were surprised as well.

00:02:19.190 --> 00:02:21.120
Repeating the year would be harsh.

00:02:21.120 --> 00:02:23.870
What was your highest score?

00:02:23.870 --> 00:02:25.590
25 in Science.

00:02:25.590 --> 00:02:27.960
23 in Geography.

00:02:27.960 --> 00:02:29.420
16 in Japanese...

00:02:30.420 --> 00:02:31.660
Your lowest?

00:02:31.660 --> 00:02:32.800
I don't want to say!

00:02:32.800 --> 00:02:34.680
Seriously, what are we going to do?

00:02:34.680 --> 00:02:37.540
I haven't scored higher than 50 once this year!

00:02:37.540 --> 00:02:39.470
We only have three days, impossible!

00:02:39.470 --> 00:02:41.720
This is just a lesson on when to give up.

00:02:42.390 --> 00:02:44.890
We could do a study session at my place.

00:02:45.780 --> 00:02:46.980
A study session?

00:02:47.370 --> 00:02:50.230
I'd rather not advance to the second year alone...

00:02:50.230 --> 00:02:51.650
Thanks, Tsuyopon!

00:02:51.650 --> 00:02:54.820
Can you really help all three of us?

00:02:56.040 --> 00:02:58.700
Maybe I could get someone else to tutor as well.

00:02:58.700 --> 00:03:00.080
For real?

00:03:00.080 --> 00:03:02.830
I'm not sure if this is a good idea...

00:03:02.830 --> 00:03:04.080
Your girlfriend?

00:03:04.080 --> 00:03:05.170
Awesome,

00:03:05.170 --> 00:03:07.670
I've only seen her pictures, so I'd like to meet her!

00:03:09.840 --> 00:03:11.240
Oh...

00:03:13.940 --> 00:03:15.550
Is there something wrong?

00:03:15.550 --> 00:03:17.720
He was talking about breaking up earlier.

00:03:17.720 --> 00:03:18.660
Really?

00:03:18.660 --> 00:03:21.350
All right, want to do a sleepover this weekend?

00:03:21.350 --> 00:03:22.520
That sounds good,

00:03:22.520 --> 00:03:24.120
Let's buy lots of snacks!

00:03:24.120 --> 00:03:25.590
How about a game tournament?

00:03:25.590 --> 00:03:26.310
Awesome!

00:03:26.310 --> 00:03:27.980
I said <i>study</i> session.

00:03:35.870 --> 00:03:38.740
We could tutor one-on-one
if there was one more person.

00:03:43.120 --> 00:03:44.120
Hi there.

00:03:49.460 --> 00:03:51.250
Oh, welcome!

00:03:51.250 --> 00:03:52.880
Pardon our intrusion!

00:03:52.880 --> 00:03:54.500
You're late, you know!

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:56.760
Oh, Mattsun, you were here already?

00:03:56.760 --> 00:03:58.280
I'm eager to start.

00:03:58.280 --> 00:03:59.340
I know right.

00:03:59.740 --> 00:04:01.010
Does anyone want tea?

00:04:01.010 --> 00:04:02.010
Me!

00:04:04.570 --> 00:04:06.100
Are you by any chance Tsuyopon's—

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:07.850
Yes, I am!

00:04:07.850 --> 00:04:10.320
Nice to meet you, I'm Asai Yukiko!

00:04:10.320 --> 00:04:11.560
Please call me Yukirin!

00:04:12.190 --> 00:04:14.470
I hear about you guys all the time.

00:04:14.470 --> 00:04:16.940
I'm happy to meet you!

00:04:16.940 --> 00:04:18.280
I know!

00:04:18.280 --> 00:04:20.660
We could cosplay a bit if we have spare time!

00:04:20.660 --> 00:04:22.830
It'd look great on you!

00:04:22.830 --> 00:04:24.150
Yukirin,

00:04:24.150 --> 00:04:25.990
please don't bother them with that.

00:04:27.210 --> 00:04:28.380
Okay...

00:04:28.380 --> 00:04:30.410
I'm sorry, Tsuyoponnu...

00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:33.330
Tsuyoponnu?!

00:04:34.330 --> 00:04:35.880
What...

00:04:35.880 --> 00:04:37.750
No, it's nothing...

00:04:39.320 --> 00:04:40.670
Oh, the door.

00:04:42.760 --> 00:04:44.670
Who else could be coming?

00:04:44.670 --> 00:04:46.050
This is everyone, right?

00:04:46.050 --> 00:04:47.480
This way.

00:04:47.480 --> 00:04:48.850
Pardon my intrusion.

00:04:52.440 --> 00:04:54.440
Thanks for having me.

00:04:55.570 --> 00:04:56.820
Wh-Why?!

00:04:56.820 --> 00:04:58.740
I invited her.

00:04:58.740 --> 00:05:00.990
She got a Top 20 score on the tests.

00:05:00.990 --> 00:05:03.200
And tutoring one-on-one is better.

00:05:03.200 --> 00:05:05.290
S-So that's why!

00:05:05.290 --> 00:05:06.450
That's amazing...

00:05:06.450 --> 00:05:08.620
Tsuyoshi did something good, for once!

00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:09.620
For once!

00:05:09.620 --> 00:05:12.250
Okay, let's get started.

00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:13.300
Okay!

00:05:13.300 --> 00:05:15.260
Now, who will tutor who...

00:05:15.260 --> 00:05:17.880
I will take the dumbest,

00:05:18.800 --> 00:05:21.460
Kobayawaka-san and Na-chan,

00:05:21.460 --> 00:05:24.130
and Yukirin and Kei-chan.

00:05:24.610 --> 00:05:26.220
I look forward to work with you!

00:05:26.220 --> 00:05:28.690
Why didn't you call me by name?

00:05:28.690 --> 00:05:30.270
No real reason.

00:05:31.790 --> 00:05:33.020
That's wrong.

00:05:33.020 --> 00:05:33.820
Ouch!

00:05:33.820 --> 00:05:35.850
Start by learning the symbols.

00:05:35.850 --> 00:05:36.980
Come on...

00:05:36.980 --> 00:05:39.650
Why am I the only one being tutored by a guy?!

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:41.990
Don't be so unreasonable.

00:05:42.920 --> 00:05:44.530
Is this thing real?

00:05:44.820 --> 00:05:47.240
I've never held one before,
it looks really painful!

00:05:47.590 --> 00:05:48.500
Interested?

00:05:48.500 --> 00:05:51.170
I would like to know more, for future reference.

00:05:51.170 --> 00:05:52.540
Ah, to use it on Tsuyopon?

00:05:52.540 --> 00:05:53.960
No way!

00:05:53.960 --> 00:05:56.170
I just really want to know!

00:05:56.170 --> 00:05:57.500
Yukirin-sensei...

00:05:58.130 --> 00:05:59.090
Yes...

00:05:59.090 --> 00:06:01.030
Kei-chan, don't distract her.

00:06:01.030 --> 00:06:02.390
Sorry.

00:06:02.390 --> 00:06:04.260
Do you want to know how to use it then?

00:06:04.260 --> 00:06:05.630
No, thanks.

00:06:06.430 --> 00:06:08.390
<i>She's really cute in her normal clothes...</i>

00:06:08.390 --> 00:06:09.140
Did you finish?

00:06:10.510 --> 00:06:12.180
Um...

00:06:13.100 --> 00:06:14.210
Hashiba-kun...

00:06:14.210 --> 00:06:15.060
Y-Yes?!

00:06:15.490 --> 00:06:17.690
Repeating a year won't be good...

00:06:34.420 --> 00:06:37.040
It's gotten pretty dark already.

00:06:37.750 --> 00:06:40.960
Hey, I'm just saying it's about
time for the girls to head home!

00:06:41.920 --> 00:06:43.840
Oh, look at the time!

00:06:43.840 --> 00:06:46.730
I'm sorry, I didn't notice.

00:06:46.730 --> 00:06:48.060
What about you three?

00:06:48.060 --> 00:06:50.010
We'll be sleeping here.

00:06:50.010 --> 00:06:51.760
Na-chan, you should walk her to the station.

00:06:52.690 --> 00:06:54.430
It'd be dangerous for her to go alone.

00:06:54.430 --> 00:06:56.270
Um, I'll be fine.

00:06:56.270 --> 00:06:57.610
No, you won't!

00:06:57.610 --> 00:06:58.480
It's dangerous!

00:06:58.940 --> 00:06:59.610
But—

00:06:59.610 --> 00:07:00.620
I'll come with you!

00:07:01.440 --> 00:07:03.820
Right, then I'll take your offer.

00:07:03.820 --> 00:07:04.610
Okay!

00:07:04.610 --> 00:07:06.910
Tsuyoponnu will walk me!

00:07:06.910 --> 00:07:07.860
Sure.

00:07:08.160 --> 00:07:09.430
See ya!

00:07:09.430 --> 00:07:10.530
Good luck, Natsuki...

00:07:10.530 --> 00:07:11.230
Bye bye!

00:07:11.230 --> 00:07:12.670
Take care.

00:07:13.790 --> 00:07:15.120
Go for it, Na-chan!

00:07:19.400 --> 00:07:20.880
We're the odd men out...

00:07:20.880 --> 00:07:22.380
We sure are.

00:07:31.640 --> 00:07:32.560
Hashiba-kun?

00:07:32.560 --> 00:07:33.640
Y-Yes?!

00:07:33.920 --> 00:07:35.520
Mind if I stop by the store?

00:07:35.520 --> 00:07:38.100
N-No problem, I'll wait for you here.

00:07:47.740 --> 00:07:51.490
I don't know why, but I really can't talk with her.

00:07:52.570 --> 00:07:53.950
I wonder why...

00:07:57.480 --> 00:07:58.960
Here.

00:07:59.350 --> 00:08:01.210
Please have some hot tea.

00:08:01.210 --> 00:08:03.300
We have a bit to go, and it's cold after all.

00:08:03.300 --> 00:08:04.630
Oh, tha—

00:08:04.630 --> 00:08:06.340
S-Sorry!

00:08:06.340 --> 00:08:07.430
This isn't right,

00:08:07.430 --> 00:08:09.390
I should have been the one to buy these.

00:08:09.390 --> 00:08:10.680
L-Let me pay for them.

00:08:10.680 --> 00:08:11.840
No, it's okay.

00:08:12.180 --> 00:08:13.600
No, it's not!

00:08:13.600 --> 00:08:14.390
It is...

00:08:14.390 --> 00:08:15.680
It's really cold.

00:08:16.080 --> 00:08:18.600
Also, consider it as a reward?

00:08:19.150 --> 00:08:21.020
Because you studied so hard.

00:08:22.960 --> 00:08:24.150
Thank you.

00:08:24.150 --> 00:08:26.690
S-Sorry, please hold on for a second.

00:08:34.820 --> 00:08:36.700
Sorry about that.

00:08:37.460 --> 00:08:38.410
All right.

00:08:39.050 --> 00:08:40.790
The meat bun or the sweet bun,

00:08:40.790 --> 00:08:42.380
which one do you want?

00:08:42.380 --> 00:08:43.170
The sweet bun.

00:08:43.170 --> 00:08:43.830
Here.

00:08:44.260 --> 00:08:48.000
You just feel like eating steamed
buns when it's cold outside.

00:08:48.510 --> 00:08:50.880
Or do girls not feel that way?

00:08:52.180 --> 00:08:54.220
No, we do.

00:08:58.440 --> 00:09:01.770
Sorry for showing up randomly today.

00:09:02.090 --> 00:09:05.190
I was really glad you were able to tutor me!

00:09:05.190 --> 00:09:06.690
Really?

00:09:06.690 --> 00:09:11.780
It's just that I never really
had a lot of friends...

00:09:11.780 --> 00:09:14.950
I've never gotten together in a big group like that.

00:09:15.300 --> 00:09:17.370
Even though we were just studying,

00:09:17.710 --> 00:09:20.040
I had a lot of fun.

00:09:21.080 --> 00:09:22.410
Thank you.

00:09:22.410 --> 00:09:24.920
I-I should be thanking you!

00:09:24.920 --> 00:09:27.220
You helped me a lot.

00:09:27.220 --> 00:09:28.420
Besides...

00:09:28.420 --> 00:09:30.340
Um...

00:09:30.850 --> 00:09:36.510
I'm just happy we could be together like this...

00:09:37.540 --> 00:09:40.270
Hashiba-kun, you're always
blushing, aren't you?

00:09:40.270 --> 00:09:42.360
Um, well...

00:09:42.360 --> 00:09:43.810
Um...

00:09:49.120 --> 00:09:50.480
Tsuyoponnu...

00:09:51.020 --> 00:09:51.610
Yes?

00:09:51.610 --> 00:09:53.240
Are you still angry?

00:09:53.910 --> 00:09:55.110
About what?

00:09:55.110 --> 00:09:56.910
Angry about my hair!

00:09:57.430 --> 00:10:00.080
I heard you were talking
about breaking up with me.

00:10:00.080 --> 00:10:02.250
Because I dyed it, right?

00:10:02.250 --> 00:10:03.450
Kei-chan said that?

00:10:03.450 --> 00:10:05.000
But the next cosplay I'm doing,

00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:06.880
is an orange haired character.

00:10:06.880 --> 00:10:09.840
It's a big event, so I'm putting effort into it.

00:10:09.840 --> 00:10:11.370
I know, but...

00:10:11.370 --> 00:10:13.050
I'm just really into black hair.

00:10:13.050 --> 00:10:16.800
I don't like it when it's otherwise,
so go back to black.

00:10:17.640 --> 00:10:20.940
Saying this after you got jealous about
me having fun with Kei-kun...

00:10:20.940 --> 00:10:22.000
I wasn't jealous.

00:10:22.000 --> 00:10:22.850
You were!

00:10:22.850 --> 00:10:23.520
I wasn't.

00:10:23.520 --> 00:10:24.560
You were jealous!

00:10:24.560 --> 00:10:26.770
I wasn't in the slightest.

00:10:28.930 --> 00:10:30.150
Oh, whatever...

00:10:30.150 --> 00:10:33.690
You called me over, so that
means you're over it.

00:10:34.630 --> 00:10:38.610
I realize that, because I'm head
over heals for my Tsuyopon!

00:10:39.920 --> 00:10:42.540
Just take it however you want.

00:10:44.740 --> 00:10:47.540
You're not honest at all, I love it.

00:10:47.540 --> 00:10:49.420
Don't forget my lack of fluency.

00:10:49.420 --> 00:10:51.290
I know !

00:10:54.450 --> 00:10:56.420
Thanks for walking me here.

00:10:56.420 --> 00:10:57.260
See you tomorrow.

00:10:57.540 --> 00:10:58.510
Yeah...

00:11:06.190 --> 00:11:07.560
Um...

00:11:08.360 --> 00:11:11.480
I'm also really happy I got
to be together with you.

00:11:12.250 --> 00:11:13.860
Bye.

00:11:20.530 --> 00:11:21.990
Huh, repeat the year?

00:11:22.510 --> 00:11:26.830
I just thought the threat might make you
take the test with more sense of urgency.

00:11:27.870 --> 00:11:29.250
Good work.
